[{:db/id "q-75317/selection/7d2c4648eab02222c1110290e66a45a8ea39506d280f7c7d2acd586476f38ee6" :answer/id #uuid "6f54804f-d6d9-5520-8733-e09934156a6c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3{x}_{i-1}^{2}+4{y}_{j-1}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75317/selection/be05b6adc6d6541b9d59f2b173b4ed87262f50332153259508cfadb8246e0577" :answer/id #uuid "51482aa7-8c11-565b-a5f8-e0ac7066f86a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5{x}_{i}^{2}+5{y}_{j}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75317/selection/fd1ab8b3aca1765ebb474e8d34c8306d59faab25e180e37ab9fa128b11ff686f" :answer/id #uuid "7abd4246-651c-52a0-b8a2-a654f768f29b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4{x}_{i}^{2}+7{y}_{j}^{2}-12" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75317/selection/0620245687f4d8df52559e961dbde98b615594a63e24041f271ddc031e3db7b0" :answer/id #uuid "349a8206-d33e-5714-9ce2-1cb16a0b7919" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4{x}_{i-1}^{2}+7{y}_{j-1}^{2}-12" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75317/selection/aa35ccc6e000d92ecc4a5984a8363592cbecd0b600c9d31536f41732d432c067" :answer/id #uuid "9639f176-7938-5239-abd2-3fc676829a4e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4{x}_{i-1}^{2}+7{y}_{j}^{2}-12" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75317/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "fc9ad9bd-d771-5696-9d72-e70329971317" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-75317/selection/0620245687f4d8df52559e961dbde98b615594a63e24041f271ddc031e3db7b0" :answer-field/choices ["q-75317/selection/7d2c4648eab02222c1110290e66a45a8ea39506d280f7c7d2acd586476f38ee6" "q-75317/selection/be05b6adc6d6541b9d59f2b173b4ed87262f50332153259508cfadb8246e0577" "q-75317/selection/fd1ab8b3aca1765ebb474e8d34c8306d59faab25e180e37ab9fa128b11ff686f" "q-75317/selection/0620245687f4d8df52559e961dbde98b615594a63e24041f271ddc031e3db7b0" "q-75317/selection/aa35ccc6e000d92ecc4a5984a8363592cbecd0b600c9d31536f41732d432c067"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-75317" :question/id #uuid "c0006173-cb6e-5c83-9a84-6d296d7de6b0" :question/math-academy-id "q-75317" :question/problem "Let $R=[3,4]\\times [5,6]$ be a region in the $xy$-plane, and let $f(x,y)=4{x}^{2}+7{y}^{2}-12.$\nFurther, let $P$ be a partition of $R,$ where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{1}={{x}_{0},{x}_{1},…,{x}_{m}},\\,{P}_{2}={{y}_{0},{y}_{1},…,{y}_{n}},\\,P={P}_{1}\\times {P}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nGiven that the lower Riemann sum of $f$ with respect to $P$ is given by\n\n$$\nL(f,P)={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}\\boxed{}\\,Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\n$$\n\nwhere $Δ{x}_{i}={x}_{i}-{x}_{i-1}$ and $Δ{y}_{j}={y}_{j}-{y}_{j-1},$ what is the missing expression in the double summation above?" :question/worked-solution "The lower Riemann sum is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{m}_{ij}Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${m}_{ij}$ is the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion ${R}_{ij}.$ \n\nWe consider an arbitrary subregion ${R}_{ij}$ of the partition. This subregion lies between ${x}_{i-1}$ and ${x}_{i}$ over the $x$-axis and ${y}_{i-1}$ and ${y}_{i}$ over the $y$-axis, as shown below. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14072378/assets/88ffe30ae5401e00502b35d851b216768aad69bf94236561617adf23e1ce058f.png)\n\nNotice that:\n\n- $f(x,y)=4{x}^{2}+7{y}^{2}-12$ increases as $x$ increases on $[3,4],$ and\n\n- $f(x,y)=4{x}^{2}+7{y}^{2}-12$ increases as $y$ increases on $[5,6].$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14072378/assets/67daa328cc6ae4cb37be386c327fb4548844fad2adc10476bdf1147c5a5d4218.png)\n\nAs a result, the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *smallest* possible $x$ and the *smallest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *bottom left corner* of each subregion. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14072378/assets/51808df96cf7dd295bfa24aa3641a601c821116e1a0014898ffe705036704a53.png)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{m}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i-1},{y}_{j-1})=4{x}_{i-1}^{2}+7{y}_{j-1}^{2}-12\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the lower Riemann sum is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(4{x}_{i-1}^{2}+7{y}_{j-1}^{2}-12)Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $4{x}_{i-1}^{2}+7{y}_{j-1}^{2}-12.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-75317/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "41a9d47a-2dd6-5177-afd1-e4adcd887f55"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-75317"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-75320/selection/0c65d655e7e9e8680a9c5cfeaace7edfe97db9d5af98078a7cbc51e7038009f0" :answer/id #uuid "4c8ced36-9159-5835-be0d-1e8b610174c6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}_{i-1}^{2}+4{y}_{j-1}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75320/selection/3e4e1464e5d533a436bf3f3802e4f324932a9cef17535ab075f6eda91df57d3b" :answer/id #uuid "fbcdb238-ef84-54ed-98f6-287f2133b8e9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3{x}_{i}^{2}+5{y}_{j-1}^{2}+7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75320/selection/51e86d7b5e19f34636b46d8a877bed354d8ac62fbcdf73afeb80d74fef38d3cb" :answer/id #uuid "9cdc8ed9-bff9-5a33-a05b-446eebe82bda" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3{x}_{i-1}^{2}+5{y}_{j-1}^{2}+7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75320/selection/bd93d79a0e41f1a73be21b2d9c6db5e2a94ffbcd13b89dff6304e8e7b4937f76" :answer/id #uuid "55239574-43ba-577e-9c61-9290e3ec9f62" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3{x}_{i}^{2}+5{y}_{j}^{2}+7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75320/selection/12bf055dda1237c7da246b5c5568ba794a4cf7582acd9010a57eb6b6db426597" :answer/id #u