84d130a96c491f2211b8b4f4d76a839107a45d6ee9fa55d" "q-75319/selection/4150c3389981922566bb6aef04592ea593bcd72d3ebf34b4e702cc1d9f77d6dd" "q-75319/selection/21fd1b0e5d3e09f6b5bcb62733a167179f12a8bf18d0bbd5fe7c03af91100314"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-75319" :question/id #uuid "131355a7-b63d-5705-94cb-98df2c475426" :question/math-academy-id "q-75319" :question/problem "Let $R=[1,5]\\times [-2,-1]$ be a region in the $xy$-plane, and let $f(x,y)=11x+2y-6.$\nFurther, let $P$ be a partition of $R,$ where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{1}={{x}_{0},{x}_{1},…,{x}_{m}},\\,{P}_{2}={{y}_{0},{y}_{1},…,{y}_{n}},\\,P={P}_{1}\\times {P}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nGiven that the lower Riemann sum of $f$ with respect to $P$ is given by\n\n$$\nL(f,P)={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}\\boxed{}\\,Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\n$$\n\nwhere $Δ{x}_{i}={x}_{i}-{x}_{i-1}$ and $Δ{y}_{j}={y}_{j}-{y}_{j-1},$ what is the missing expression in the double summation above?" :question/worked-solution "The lower Riemann sum is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{m}_{ij}Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${m}_{ij}$ is the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion ${R}_{ij}.$ \n\nWe consider an arbitrary subregion ${R}_{ij}$ of the partition. This subregion lies between ${x}_{i-1}$ and ${x}_{i}$ over the $x$-axis and ${y}_{i-1}$ and ${y}_{i}$ over the $y$-axis, as shown below. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14072378/assets/88ffe30ae5401e00502b35d851b216768aad69bf94236561617adf23e1ce058f.png)\n\nNotice that:\n\n- $f(x,y)=11x+2y-6$ increases as $x$ increases, and\n\n- $f(x,y)=11x+2y-6$ increases as $y$ increases.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14072378/assets/67daa328cc6ae4cb37be386c327fb4548844fad2adc10476bdf1147c5a5d4218.png)\n\nAs a result, the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *smallest* possible $x$ and the *smallest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *bottom left corner* of each subregion. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14072378/assets/51808df96cf7dd295bfa24aa3641a601c821116e1a0014898ffe705036704a53.png)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{m}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i-1},{y}_{j-1})=11{x}_{i-1}+2{y}_{j-1}-6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the lower Riemann sum is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(11{x}_{i-1}+2{y}_{j-1}-6)Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $11{x}_{i-1}+2{y}_{j-1}-6.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-75319/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "41a9d47a-2dd6-5177-afd1-e4adcd887f55"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-75319"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-75318/selection/e301a631ac0edfd17f337052d261cd0ae13a1e58d7d9f4f2284e72c67761a984" :answer/id #uuid "def2cc33-4d16-5ed2-a8ef-5241770f7ea6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5{x}_{i-1}+8{y}_{j-1}+11" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75318/selection/822d88a77e15555ee2d862184c86091a10c73bb46873b2cf4bf1686c9ae86d25" :answer/id #uuid "ed898f91-90c9-5556-b564-d7eb2da4a0d0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5{x}_{i}+8{y}_{j}+11" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75318/selection/e74b9b992b8796e234185bea5d303a3de5536efebdb002d3bec8a561167daa9c" :answer/id #uuid "ad0ca56d-06cb-5c7f-88ea-86c3dbfec149" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}_{i}+4{y}_{j}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75318/selection/4d41a41b5a4a5af36a1dbb3f7ae23beec0e504aabd87c14afbd68cd15bb09942" :answer/id #uuid "19162239-84b3-597e-91f3-e1be5a0ab5d4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5{x}_{i-1}+8{y}_{j}+11" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 