apture-workers/multivariable/14072378/assets/ce0d90127e1f14654f4b32a933f1eb6e76e054c03f19ca40c3f04116aa3c2c93.png)\n\nAs a result, the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *largest* possible $x$ and the *largest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *top right corner* of each subregion. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14072378/assets/4a10c8332a5f346d393c37531c13db6aa69d4cecb241efd7c34d57f32d5a98b8.png)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{m}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i},{y}_{j})=40-{x}_{i}-4{y}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the lower Riemann sum is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(40-{x}_{i}-4{y}_{j})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $40-{x}_{i}-4{y}_{j}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-75324/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "bd33f89c-3adc-5b57-b7b7-4877a9e54e11"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-75324"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-75329/selection/22bb0becd3408fc27a9cc1cb4eeb284d1f6530bff11f1a45c15268b92d803bdf" :answer/id #uuid "5b5c2c13-28cc-5fa2-b369-20ebd766c327" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "50-4{x}_{i-1}^{2}-11{y}_{j-1}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75329/selection/1ed2570076ccdfe474d27ec6e2c8f62148cf12d0b83ea5cefdea8d2bfa3398f2" :answer/id #uuid "2bdfb7ee-5f8e-5a9c-a86d-d1a457369a10" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "50-4{x}_{i}^{2}-11{y}_{j-1}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75329/selection/819a9472383a697002ca94257a99be8df97b3827d9dacb8d2052d00aef91a21c" :answer/id #uuid "6682dabd-c3fb-543d-a8e1-579be791f85f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "50-4{x}_{i}^{2}-11{y}_{j}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75329/selection/3c35470f213c65d41b3dbe52a1f