n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{1}={{x}_{0},{x}_{1},…,{x}_{m}},\\,{P}_{2}={{y}_{0},{y}_{1},…,{y}_{n}},\\,P={P}_{1}\\times {P}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nGiven that the lower Riemann sum of $f$ with respect to $P$ is given by\n\n$$\nL(f,P)={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}\\boxed{}\\,Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\n$$\n\nwhere $Δ{x}_{i}={x}_{i}-{x}_{i-1}$ and $Δ{y}_{j}={y}_{j}-{y}_{j-1},$ what is the missing expression in the double summation above?" :question/worked-solution "The lower Riemann sum is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{m}_{ij}Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${m}_{ij}$ is the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion ${R}_{ij}.$ \n\nWe consider an arbitrary subregion ${R}_{ij}$ of the partition. This subregion lies between ${x}_{i-1}$ and ${x}_{i}$ over the $x$-axis and ${y}_{i-1}$ and ${y}_{i}$ over the $y$-axis, as shown below. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14072378/assets/88ffe30ae5401e00502b35d851b216768aad69bf94236561617adf23e1ce058f.png)\n\nNotice that:\n\n- $f(x,y)=7x-4y$ increases as $x$ increases, and\n\n- $f(x,y)=7x-4y$ decreases as $y$ increases.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14072378/assets/01b291ca7cd81b88cf6ed06fdcdb2ffcbb1f78255d0f57d496823d347c2fb0b3.png)\n\nAs a result, the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *smallest* possible $x$ and the *largest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *top left corner* of each subregion.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14072378/assets/a44c2586978022663635d1f35399166c1ae32963fe0f4bffebd21966ad40bac5.png)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{m}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i-1},{y}_{j})=7{x}_{i-1}-4{y}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the lower Riemann sum is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{L}_{(}f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(7{x}_{i-1}-4{y}_{j})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $7{x}_{i-1}-4{y}_{j}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-123514/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "afd97f63-933b-5595-8b4d-01f14c3bff53"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-123514"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-123513/selection/872e979056c4a1e6bb50e416a6a1daff55c8b21e0e6b3a6f62b69ffe9e5116af" :answer/id #uuid "0c3e7b5e-44a8-5d51-8f84-74788533da77" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5{x}_{i-1}-3{y}_{j}+20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123513/selection/670b99ed97b57f1d011a23ca5569178c213c5272129af5a255799186518cab78" :answer/id #uuid "c856e7bc-cfd7-54a1-8ef8-ae24a7c41757" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5{x}_{i}-3{y}_{j-1}+20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123513/selection/01bd99034523c6f0bffffc2223ea2a0453409ded9a203010546b286e9c9edac2" :answer/id #uuid "59a39267-42dd-59f6-b8ac-ed7821fc16e6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-{x}_{i-1}+{y}_{j}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123513/selection/4fc1b8f732c1e2b84d22ede4cdbf823c4c8f423ca426b155255abd2dcca01d82" :answer/id #uuid "5a975324-ecaf-5d66-8df0-75f6c3f554cc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5{x}_{i-1}-3{y}_{j-1}+20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123513/selection/dcf1bd3b930e7caeb1c669b28330e7b7f80169686ef7aff6a0937683f3eb6d67" :answer/id #uuid "edc5d4d4-bbe7-5aa0-b4a6-9fac443990c0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}_{i}+2{y}_{j-1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123513/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "e610f67b-00dd-5fef-97e9-8909e0df6998" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-123513/selection/872e979056c4a1e6bb50e416a6a1daff55c8b21e0e6b3a6f62b69ffe9e5116af" :answer-field/choices 