hacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14072378/assets/01b291ca7cd81b88cf6ed06fdcdb2ffcbb1f78255d0f57d496823d347c2fb0b3.png)\n\nAs a result, the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *smallest* possible $x$ and the *largest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *top left corner* of each subregion.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14072378/assets/a44c2586978022663635d1f35399166c1ae32963fe0f4bffebd21966ad40bac5.png)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{m}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i-1},{y}_{j})=5{x}_{i-1}-3{y}_{j}+20\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the lower Riemann sum is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{L}_{(}f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(5{x}_{i-1}-3{y}_{j}+20)Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $5{x}_{i-1}-3{y}_{j}+20.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-123513/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "afd97f63-933b-5595-8b4d-01f14c3bff53"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-123513"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-123518/selection/fc148ab2a304745c93de28ce66e50f5db64f8fb53b2b4c95b7deba02a6599160" :answer/id #uuid "68c2bc1d-4817-5c65-83a9-91b43f986bc4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4{y}_{j-1}-5{x}_{i}-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123518/selection/9af9d7bcf2396272061b5194a923e2d97c3e2e4102ba70dfe92ef4bea6b4303a" :answer/id #uuid "01281bef-6d85-5b96-b224-de1ac1918ed1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{y}_{j}-2{x}_{i-1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123518/selection/d8a43ebe5e3122eb07bc02f6768a9dfd8497722198f537ce3be60dc649ce6d79" :answer/id #uuid "fffcffcb-858a-5b63-82ce-35d3ae0cfb36" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{y}_{j-1}-2{x}_{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123518/selection/2c5fbd80641fc16f08b2